      "line_num": 39,
      "source": "todo_md",
      "tags": [
        "#critical"
      ],
      "text": "**Ship 2.3.1 \u2014 Jidoka spine + three Poka-Yoke children: `distribution.env` hardlinked across AI-UI, homebrew-apps, Sage.Education-docs (the atom); each repo's Makefile reads it; three bug-fix children \u2014 env-gate dependency order (`sage_runtime.py`), SPA `/api/*` JSON 404 (`main.py`), ML wizard transitional fix (uv + hashed `requirements-ml.lock`, CPU-only torch via pytorch.org/whl/cpu, `sitecustomize.py` keeps ml_packages after system site-packages, base `requirements.txt` pins `tokenizers<=0.23.0`/`huggingface-hub<1.0`/`numpy<2`). Plus CVE bumps (`langchain 0.3.30`, `python-multipart 0.0.27`). Validated by `scripts/wizard-smoke.sh` driving the install + embedding + add-to-KB flow end-to-end via API. CHANGELOG labels the ML fix as transitional on the kaizen (\u6539\u5584) path; structural fix is the signed per-arch \u00d7 per-accel tarball bundle (Shape B) shipping in 2.4. Plan: `~/.claude/plans/given-our-newest-trends-modular-sloth.md`.**\n- [x] ML wizard fix: both `sys.path.insert(0)` calls in `retrieval.py` flipped to `sys.path.append` (embedding install + chromadb install paths)\n- [x] ML wizard fix: delete PYTHONPATH block in `start.sh:6-10`\n- [x] ML wizard fix: `sitecustomize.py` RUN in Dockerfile (loads ml_packages after site-packages)\n- [x] ML wizard fix: replace pip with `uv` (pinned in Dockerfile); single-pass install from hashed `requirements-ml.lock` generated by `uv pip compile --generate-hashes`\n- [x] ML wizard fix: `--extra-index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu` in `requirements-ml.in` \u2192 torch installs CPU-only (0 nvidia-* deps, ~5GB saved)\n- [x] ML wizard fix: base `requirements.txt` pins `tokenizers<=0.23.0` + `huggingface-hub<1.0` + `numpy<2` so chromadb/langchain-community transitives stay inside the range transformers 4.57.6 accepts\n- [x] Security: bump `langchain` to 0.3.30 (CVE-2026-45134) + `python-multipart` to 0.0.27 (CVE-2026-42561)\n- [x] CUDA path removed from `retrieval.py` for 2.3.1; 2.4 bundle ships per-arch \u00d7 per-accel matrix\n- [x] Env-gate fix: `sage_runtime.py` lifted `_require_try_sage_enabled` ahead of `get_admin_user` Depends\n- [x] SPA fall-through fix: `main.py` returns JSON 404 for unmatched `/api/*`\n- [x] `try_sage_stop` removed from Makefile; `try_sage_reset` cleans up inline\n- [x] `CONVENTION.instructions.md` documents the FastAPI env-gate dependency-ordering contract\n- [x] Canonical `distribution.env` created in homebrew-apps\n- [x] `distribution_sync` + `distribution_verify` Makefile targets in all three repos; verify wired into `release_finish` + `hotfix_finish`\n- [x] All three Makefiles `-include distribution.env`; AI-UI defaults `VOLUME_DATA` + `IMAGE_TAG` from it\n- [x] homebrew-apps `ai-ui` CLI bumped to 1.1.0; sources `distribution.env`; `--tag X.Y.Z` flag on `start`, `try`, `update`\n- [x] homebrew-apps Formula caveats updated (`ai-ui.rb` + `ai-ui@1.rb`)\n- [x] homebrew-apps README documents the `distribution.env` contract + two-version-track + `git flow feature start` policy\n- [x] Hardlink chain established (`make distribution_sync` from any sibling; verify shows 3 links across all three repos)\n- [x] PANEL_PUSH_HISTORY entry for 2026-05-12 panel (Arment / Hashimoto / Hickey) appended to `.env`; prior malformed line fixed\n- [x] `test@example.com` / `zaq12wsx` ratified as the canonical Sage.is automated-smoke test user (used by `scripts/wizard-smoke.sh`, future Selenium, ZAP)\n- [x] `scripts/wizard-smoke.sh` written: clean-container API-driven smoke (signup \u2192 install \u2192 embedding \u2192 import smoke \u2192 file upload \u2192 add-to-KB 200). Wired into `make wizard_smoke`. `KEEP_ON_FAIL=1` default preserves container on failure for debug.\n- [x] Built `:bug-verify` image on Alexander's silicon (Apple Silicon)\n- [x] Wizard verify on `:bug-verify` end-to-end (manual via API + automated via `make wizard_smoke`): login pre/post wizard, `bcrypt.__file__` at `/usr/local/lib`, embedding model downloads, `POST /api/v1/knowledge/{kb}/file/add` returns 200\n- [x] Commit bug-fixes + CVE pins + CONVENTION + tester + distribution.env on develop (AI-UI: `1248f2b`)\n- [x] Spine commits: homebrew-apps Makefile `-include` (`b1a55bb`); docs Makefile + distribution.env (`c02cd36`)\n- [x] `make patch_release` \u2192 `release/2.3.1` created\n- [x] `make bump_release_version` (app/package.json 2.3.0 \u2192 2.3.1)\n- [x] CHANGELOG.md 2.3.1 entry written above [2.3.0] (Added/Fixed/Security/Changed/Docs blocks)\n- [ ] Cross-arch smoke via buildx + QEMU: `make cross_smoke IMAGE_TAG=bug-verify` (builds linux/amd64, runs wizard end-to-end on Apple Silicon host \u2014 no teammate needed). 2.3.1 added `it_build_amd64` and `cross_smoke` Makefile targets + `PLATFORM` env in `scripts/wizard-smoke.sh`.\n- [ ] [MANUALLY] Commit the release-branch artifacts (CHANGELOG, TODO, package.json, README.md) on `release/2.3.1`\n- [ ] [MANUALLY] Smoke loop on release-tagged image (`it_build`, `test_db_upgrade`, `test_db_fresh`, `it_run`, `wizard_smoke IMAGE_TAG=2.3.1`)\n- [ ] [MANUALLY] Staging deploy verification (CapRover staging if available) BEFORE pushing `:latest`\n- [ ] [MANUALLY] `make ghcr_login` \u2192 `make release_and_push_GHCR`\n- [ ] Regenerate `KANBAN.canvas` from finalized TODO.md\n- [ ] **2.4 follow-up (separate plan)** \u2014 signed per-arch \u00d7 per-accel ML bundle tarballs on GitHub Releases; wizard pulls via `curl | sha256sum -c | tar -xz`; `distribution.env` carries `ML_BUNDLE_TAG` + per-variant SHA256s; decommission `sitecustomize.py` and runtime uv install; CUDA returns as a first-class matrix cell. `requirements-ml.lock` from 2.3.1 is the build input \u2014 no thrown-away work.\n\n`#critical`\n`TODO.md:L39`",
