          "tags": [],
          "text": "Float the banner above the app shell rather than reflowing it inline. Outer wrapper `position:fixed; top:0.5rem; left:0; right:0; z:40; pointer-events:none`. Inner pill `max-w:60ch; margin:0 auto; pointer-events:auto; rounded; subtle shadow`. Doesn't push navbar/content down on first paint and z-index keeps it above the sidebar."
